msgid "The data is read by read-only tools on the Flux AI & MCP server and in Flux AI chat: flxp_summary, flxp_requests, flxp_request, flxp_slow_queries, flxp_php_errors, flxp_http_calls, flxp_environment, flxp_server, flxp_database, flxp_autoload, flxp_cron, flxp_profile_url."
